     "type": "text",
     "props": {
      "html": "<h3>Infant, Toddler, and Preschool Enrollment</h3><p>Families of Infants, Toddlers, and Preschool children must complete the following and return it to the Preschool Office prior to your child’s first day:</p><ul><li><p><strong>License Exempt Center Enrollment Form</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Preschool Physician Waiver signed by a physician</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Up to Date Shot Record</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Notice of Parental Responsibility</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Personal Information Card (2)</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Child Care Payment Authorization Form</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Voided check for ACH withdrawal</strong></p></li></ul>"
     },
